		<link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-elites-might-hoard-intelligence-like-mercantilists-hoarded-gold/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/ai-elites-might-hoard-intelligence-like-mercantilists-hoarded-gold/#respond</comments>
		
